{
  "name": "ElevenLabs post-call webhook to sheet + follow-up Gmail draft",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Post-call webhook (original)\nElevenLabs sends `post_call_transcription` after each agent call. This verifies the HMAC signature, logs the call to Google Sheets and, when the caller left an email, writes a follow-up as a **Gmail draft** (never sent automatically).\nSet the agent's *Data collection* fields `name`, `email`, `follow_up`.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "1fffe195-5a16-5e9d-93e3-c28becfa0130",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -400
      ]
    },
